#: cdd8d29dcde147b3b230cba9e33ba8d8
msgid ""
"[Private hardware interfaces](2-private_hi.md) names the private packages"
" (Rokae, Eyou, iNex, Wuji, DexCap, Fairino). Configuration keys, "
"IP/serial layouts, and SDK env vars are in **that repository’s README "
"after access**. This page does not list undocumented private SDK "
"parameters. #120 likewise skipped private `hardwares/*` gitmodules."
msgstr ""
"[私有硬件接口](2-private_hi.md) "
"列出私有包（Rokae、Eyou、iNex、Wuji、DexCap、Fairino）。配置键、IP/串口布局和 SDK 环境变量见**开通后该仓库"
" README**。本页不罗列未写入文档的私有 SDK 参数。#120 同样跳过了私有 `hardwares/*` gitmodules。"

