#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`{robot}_description/config/ocs2/*.info` (and the generated library under"
" `config/ocs2/generated`) are **OCS2 task / model files**, not ROS 2 "
"parameters. `robot_name` chooses the description package at startup — "
"[Controller ROS 2 parameters](../controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md)."
msgstr ""
"`{robot}_description/config/ocs2/*.info`（以及 `config/ocs2/generated` "
"下的生成库）是 **OCS2 任务 / 模型文件**，不是 ROS 2 参数。`robot_name` 在启动时选择描述包 — [控制器 ROS "
"2 参数](../controllers/8-ros2_parameters.md)。"

